# Phase-4 replay archive — block break: a drops-carrying break report without
# the sender's recorded applied air-write is refused. The host never applies
# the drops, never relays, and rolls the breaker's copy back with ItemReject
# (BlockAlreadyBroken). GetBlock cannot make this decision — the block is air
# for every side; the record is the only first-writer proof.
#
# Fossil of: BlockBreakSimulationTests.BreakWithoutAirWriteRecord_Refused
# Mechanism: BlockBreakArbitration.TryAccept returns false with no record,
#            ItemService.SendItemReject(BlockAlreadyBroken)

@0 break g1 9 9 drops=99:ore
@33 expect block_accepted 0 within 500
@33 expect block_reject g1 ItemReject 1
